    16	findings and protected names, numbers and negation. The runner checks complete
    17	rewrites, exact source offsets, settled history, duplicates versus semantic claims,
    18	scene evidence versus proposed details, bounded paragraph/entity requests, explicit
    19	instruction constraints, pinned local model manifests, and cancellation/source
